   512	**Lemma ELIMINANT.**  `W_r = B_r^2 T_{t,2t-1} - G_r (a_0 G_r - 2 a_0 C_r + b_0 B_r)`.
   513	Hence `W_r in J_t^tail cap P_t`, and if `V(W_1,..,W_{t-1}) = {0}` in `Spec P_t`
   514	then `V(J_t^tail) = {0}` (a zero of the tail projects to a common zero of the
   515	`W_r`; over the origin of `P_t` the top row is `a_0 b3^2` with `a_0` a unit, so
   516	`b3=0`).  The identity is verified symbolically in indeterminates
   517	(`eliminant_certificate.out`), hence for all `t,r`, and equals sympy's
   518	`Res_{b3}(T_{t,2t-1}, G_r)` on the nose.  At `t=3`, mod 1009 on both fibres,
   519	`W_r` is nonzero and reduces to zero against a Groebner basis of `J_3^tail`
