   521	
   522	This is the charged Lemma SQUARE (fable5 Sec. 5.2) in linearised form: because
   523	`G_r` is b3-*linear*, the general two-quadratic Sylvester expression collapses to
   524	the three-term `W_r` above, and its cofactors are explicit.
   525	
   526	**The cost of the elimination is exactly `2^{t-2}`.**  The square system
   527	`W_1..W_{t-1}` consists of `t-1` forms of weights `4t+6, 4t+8, .., 6t+2` in
   528	`t-1` variables of weights `1,..,t-1`, so its Bezout number is
