+
+The unit `a_0=-alpha_t` is uniform for `t>=3`, and `d_Gamma(t)` is known.  The
+all-t nonvanishing is not proved.  LENGTH-SPLIT does not close the gap.
+
+Target B is reduced to an exact radical-membership certificate:
