+  row file at root `11288`.
+- Prime label/derivative: `p` is always a finite-field characteristic; prime
+  marks from Laurent formulas are not used as derivatives here.
+- Modular promotion: only homogeneous cone `dim=0` statements are promoted
+  through the charged properness gate.  Rabinowitsch radical membership modulo
+  `p` is not promoted.
+- No interpolation: no all-t certificate is inferred from the fixed range
+  `t<=7`.
